4. lets I have 10 partitions and I want to assign number of CPU core as well to that spark job so how do you give no CPU core you needed?
=> ✅ CPU Core Allocation & Partitions
  Each task = 1 partition = 1 core (at a time).
  So if you have:
  10 partitions → up to 10 tasks.
  Assigning more than 10 cores = wasted resources.
  Executor tuning rule of thumb:
  Try to align number of partitions with total number of available cores.
